WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.900
[Leaves rustle softly]

2
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.800
Benu: Today I’ll tell it. There was a little boat…

3
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.700
[A quiet breeze on the verandah]

4
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:15.400
Madhab Kaka: Whose boat?

5
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.800
Benu: Let me tell it first!

6
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.600
[A soft rustle of clothing]

7
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:32.500
Madhab Kaka: This question-asking habit feels familiar.

8
00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:37.200
Benu: Did you learn it from me?

9
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.800
[A soft rustle of clothing]

10
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:49.500
Benu: The boat belongs to my story. And now it set off…

11
00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:55.500
[Leaves rustle softly]
